##  Lab Description

This lab demonstrates how to **manage and monitor services on an Amazon Linux 2 EC2 instance**.  
You will verify that the Apache web server (`httpd`) is running, test HTTP connectivity, and monitor the system using Linux and AWS tools.

---

## Objectives

In this lab, you will:

- Check the status of the **httpd service**
- Ensure an **HTTP connection to localhost** works
- Monitor your **Amazon Linux 2 EC2 instance**
- Use the **Linux `top` command**
- Monitor instance metrics using **AWS CloudWatch**

---

## Technologies Used

- Amazon EC2
- Amazon Linux 2
- Apache HTTP Server (httpd)
- Linux systemctl
- Linux top command
- AWS CloudWatch

